  Task Start: 2024-04-26T16:58:01Z
  Task End: 2024-04-26T16:58:01Z
  Transfer Progress: 100 %
  Transfer Bytes: 350 bytes
  File Size: 350 bytes
  Transfer Rate: 3 kbps

Installation State: install-success
--------------------------------------------------
