Step 4: Switch the standby image to be the boot image and reboot the switch:

OS10#
OS10# boot system standby
OS10#
OS10# reload

Proceed to reboot the system? [confirm yes/no]:yes"
  reference   : "800-171|3.4.2,800-171r3|03.04.02a.,800-53|CM-6b.,800-53r5|CM-6b.,CAT|I,CCI|CCI-000366,CN-L3|8.1.10.6(d),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF2.0|DE.CM-09,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,DISA_Benchmark|Dell_OS10_Switch_NDM_STIG,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.9,ITSG-33|CM-6b.,NESA|T3.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-269804r1051797_rule,STIG-ID|OS10-NDM-000980,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-269804"
  see_also    : "https://dl.dod.cyber.mil/wp-content/uploads/stigs/zip/U_Dell_OS10_Switch_Y26M04_STIG.zip"
